  continueButton: {fileID: 736668451}
  showEveryLaunch: 0
  introMessage: "Karaci\u011Ferimizi Tan\u0131yal\u0131m\n\nKaraci\u011Fer, v\xFCcudun
    en b\xFCy\xFCk i\xE7 organ\u0131d\u0131r; detoksifikasyon, protein sentezi ve
    safra \xFCretimi gibi 500'den fazla g\xF6revi vard\u0131r.\n\nBu uygulama, nakil
    sonras\u0131 onar\u0131m, ila\xE7 uyumu, red riski ve ya\u015Fam tarz\u0131n\u0131
    AR \xFCzerinde g\xF6rsel olarak incelemeniz i\xE7in haz\u0131rlanm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r.\n\nTan\u0131
    koymaz \u2014 sorular\u0131n\u0131z i\xE7in mutlaka transplant ekibinize dan\u0131\u015F\u0131n."
